SUMMARY:THIS SATURDAY NIGHT LATE SHOW | Funkwondo
DESCRIPTION:Saturday Night June 20 | 10pm til late | The One Stop at Asheville Music Hall | Name Your Own Price \nGo see Big Something at Pisgah\, then head right on over to catch us for a funky after party. \n“Funkwondo embodies what live music should be: spontaneous\, communal\, and irresistibly fun. Their philosophy of funk as both art form and playful experiment shines through in every measure.” -Fuel The Scene Magazine \nFunkwondo was born out of a groove centric mindflow. Their approach is soulful\, playful\, psychedelic funk\, fusion\, among many other genre blends. Currently out on all platforms are 3 singles: Keep Up\, Forever on the Run\, & Malfunktion. \nThe band continues its natural evolution all while cutting their teeth in the local scene\, opening for Sneezy\, Kind Thieves\, Consider the Source\, and Joslyn & The Sweet Compression.  Always finding something new and unique with each show\, as well as adding special guests\, Funkwondo sets its sights on its promising future\, but most importantly\, the art of funk.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/this-saturday-night-late-show-funkwondo/
LOCATION:The One Stop\, 55 College Street\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Screenshot-2026-06-08-162300-e1780950276459.png
GEO:35.594979;-82.5530548
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The One Stop 55 College Street Asheville NC 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=55 College Street:geo:-82.5530548,35.594979
END:VEVENT
