BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260619T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T010000
DTSTAMP:20260620T002117
CREATED:20260602T203426Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260617T110311Z
UID:10066343-1781895600-1781917200@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Official Downtown After 5 After Party: Daisy Chain (ft. Tommi Janae) & Bryce Hensley
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Fitz and the Wolfe with Daisy Chain for the Official After Party for Downtown After 5\, in partnership with the Asheville Downtown Association.\nAn energetic 5-piece rock band out of Clemson\, SC\, Daisy Chain doesn’t ease into a night. They kick the door open. With a lineup featuring dual guitars\, driving rhythm section\, and powerhouse vocals\, their set rips through 80s classic rock\, 90s staples\, 2000s punk pop\, and rocked-up takes on current hits. The kind of mix that keeps the floor full and the volume exactly where it should be.\nFrom 7PM to 11PM\, expect high energy\, loud singalongs\, and a crowd that’s fully committed by the second chorus.\n\nThen from 11PM to 1AM\, Bryce Hensley takes it late with an acoustic set that leans into something more personal. An Asheville native with a story that runs from the ballfield to the stage\, Bryce brings a country sound shaped by gospel roots and real-life turns. It’s honest\, stripped down\, and the kind of set that hits a little closer to home as the night winds on.\nThe party starts loud\, then settles in just right. Grab a cocktail and keep the Downtown After 5 momentum going.\n  \n$5-$10 cover on weekends. \nThe Best Night Out in Downtown Asheville! | Honky Tonk | Speakeasy | Private Events | Craft Cocktails & Late Night Bites \nFitz and the Wolfe is a cocktail and music venue shaped by the spirit of improvisation\, storytelling\, and the kind of nights that feel too good to end. Here\, every night brings a new soundtrack. Jazz\, swing\, honky-tonk\, and sometimes things a little more esoteric—if it moves people\, we book it. The music fills the space like a second heartbeat\, sometimes rowdy\, sometimes intimate\, always memorable. It’s not background noise. It’s the reason you’re here. fitzandthewolfe.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/official-downtown-after-5-after-party-daisy-chain-ft-tommi-janae-bryce-hensley/
LOCATION:Fitz and the Wolfe\, 1 Battery Park Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot-2026-06-17-070205-e1781694180337.png
GEO:35.5954515;-82.5548502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Fitz and the Wolfe 1 Battery Park Ave Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1 Battery Park Ave:geo:-82.5548502,35.5954515
END:VEVENT
