SUMMARY:A Day of Art + Music ft. Decoda and artists from the Decoda Chamber Music Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a vibrant Day of Art + Music at the Asheville Art Museum\, featuring Decoda and artists from the Decoda Chamber Music Festival (DCMF). This all-ages experience invites you to explore the museum through sound\, creativity\, and connection. \nEnjoy an interactive performance\, take part in hands-on workshops that blend listening\, composing\, and visual art-making\, and wander the galleries on a self-guided musical tour—where works of art are paired with live performances by DCMF musicians. The day culminates in Arboretum in the Museum\, an immersive musical experience in which solo performances unfold simultaneously throughout the space\, transforming the museum into a living\, breathing soundscape. \nSchedule \nNoon–12:30pm — Live Music on the Plaza \n12:30–1:15pm — Interactive Performance (Decoda Artists) \n1:30–2pm — Creative Art & Music Making & Live Music on the Plaza \n2–2:45pm — Musical Gallery Tour \n2:45–3:15pm — Creative Art & Music Making \n3:30pm — Arboretum in the Museum \n————— \nFree for Members or included with Museum admission. \nTickets: https://www.ashevilleart.org/visit/ticket-options/
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/a-day-of-art-music-ft-decoda-and-artists-from-the-decoda-chamber-music-festival/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Asheville Art Museum 2 South Pack Square Asheville NC 28801;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2 South Pack Square:geo:-82.5512827,35.5946714
END:VEVENT
