UID:10056216-1781964000-1781974800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Sip Slow Saturday w/ Marley’s Chain
DESCRIPTION:At Addison Farms\, we are always looking for ways to bring great food\, good people\, and meaningful experiences together here in Leicester.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMarley’s Chain (musicians Angela Gipson and David Hintz) is a rockabilly and vintage country rock duo known for strong harmonies and an easy\, seasoned sound.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWe’re intentional about who we invite to the vineyard. Whether it’s a food truck or a musician\, we look for people who care deeply about what they make and how they share it.\n\n\n\nWe hope you will stay awhile\, and sip slow.\n\n\n\nEvent Highlights:\n• Live music by Marley’s Chain | 2-5 PM | From soulful ballads to rousing rockabilly\, Americana\, country and rock\, we have you covered with new twists on well-known hits\, deep tracks and originals.\n• Addison Farms wine by the glass or bottle\n• Sweeping mountain views\, golden hour vibes\, and a laid-back countryside setting\n\nGrassroots Pizza on site!!!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/sip-slow-saturday-w-marleys-chain/
LOCATION:Addison Farms Vineyard Leicester\, 4005 New Leicester Hwy\, Leicester\, NC\, 28748\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.7051943;-82.7444696
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Addison Farms Vineyard Leicester 4005 New Leicester Hwy Leicester NC 28748 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=4005 New Leicester Hwy:geo:-82.7444696,35.7051943
END:VEVENT
